1
00:00:56,960 --> 00:00:57,880
Who are you?

2
00:00:58,080 --> 00:00:58,880
Why aren't you sleeping in the middle of the night?

3
00:00:58,880 --> 00:00:59,880
What are you doing here?

4
00:00:59,880 --> 00:01:02,940
I'm the patient who came to get bandaged during the day.

5
00:01:03,160 --> 00:01:04,560
You're Wang Hong, right?

6
00:01:04,599 --> 00:01:05,160
Yes.

7
00:01:06,120 --> 00:01:07,120
My name is Yang Songman.

8
00:01:07,120 --> 00:01:08,200
I'm a nurse here.

9
00:01:09,440 --> 00:01:10,960
Your injury is so severe.

10
00:01:10,960 --> 00:01:12,160
Instead of resting well,

11
00:01:12,160 --> 00:01:13,520
why are you wandering around?

12
00:01:13,520 --> 00:01:15,000
Go back to your room and rest. Let's go.

13
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:15,400
Okay.

14
00:01:19,160 --> 00:01:21,200
This is the girl who was with you, right?

15
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:22,160
Let's keep our voices down

16
00:01:22,160 --> 00:01:23,420
so we don't wake her up.

17
00:01:23,920 --> 00:01:25,120
Get into bed quickly.

18
00:01:34,440 --> 00:01:36,039
Call me if you need anything. I'm leaving now.

19
00:01:36,039 --> 00:01:37,000
I'll be right outside.

20
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:38,600
Call me if you need anything.

21
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:11,800
Lin.

22
00:02:16,560 --> 00:02:17,200
Mr. Lin.

23
00:02:17,960 --> 00:02:18,560
Mr. Lin.

24
00:02:19,760 --> 00:02:20,320
I'm

25
00:02:21,680 --> 00:02:22,360
here.

26
00:02:22,360 --> 00:02:23,200
Resting?

27
00:02:24,240 --> 00:02:26,000
Well, I found out.

28
00:02:26,760 --> 00:02:29,320
It was that bastard Teng Xiaohu who hired someone to do it.

29
00:02:29,320 --> 00:02:30,280
God knows where he got

30
00:02:30,280 --> 00:02:31,600
a wild boar in heat from.

31
00:02:31,600 --> 00:02:34,600
He timed it perfectly for when you took Mr. Wang there.

32
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:36,800
And those bastards from the forest patrol

33
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:38,160
betrayed us

34
00:02:38,160 --> 00:02:40,160
and took 2,000 yuan from Teng Xiaohu.

35
00:02:40,160 --> 00:02:41,640
They sold out our schedule and itinerary

36
00:02:41,640 --> 00:02:44,120
completely.

37
00:02:46,800 --> 00:02:47,930
He's not important.

38
00:02:48,760 --> 00:02:51,079
What do we do next?

39
00:02:52,520 --> 00:02:54,850
Don't worry about the forest farm for now.

40
00:02:56,120 --> 00:02:56,720
By the way.

41
00:02:57,400 --> 00:02:58,840
How are the talks about the redwood

42
00:02:58,840 --> 00:02:59,760
from Russia going?

43
00:02:59,760 --> 00:03:01,520
I'm still following up on it.

44
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:06,040
Still following up?

45
00:03:06,200 --> 00:03:07,480
Until when?

46
00:03:08,360 --> 00:03:09,400
You need to hurry.

47
00:03:11,840 --> 00:03:12,640
Listen.

48
00:03:14,280 --> 00:03:16,000
If the redwood from Russia

49
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:17,040
is of good quality,

50
00:03:17,040 --> 00:03:17,680
remember,

51
00:03:17,800 --> 00:03:19,660
it must have no knots or bug holes.

52
00:03:20,840 --> 00:03:22,079
And if the price is reasonable,

53
00:03:22,079 --> 00:03:23,079
secure it ASAP.

54
00:03:25,040 --> 00:03:27,570
Two thousand cubic meters of red pine timber.

55
00:03:27,600 --> 00:03:28,480
This order,

56
00:03:29,240 --> 00:03:30,680
no matter the cost,

57
00:03:31,280 --> 00:03:32,520
we must secure it.

58
00:03:32,880 --> 00:03:34,680
Got it. I'll get on it right now.

59
00:03:34,840 --> 00:03:35,560
Hurry up.

60
00:03:50,440 --> 00:03:51,280
Wait a minute.

61
00:03:53,600 --> 00:03:55,280
Here are some oral anti-inflammatory pills

62
00:03:55,280 --> 00:03:56,440
and gauze for dressing changes.

63
00:03:56,440 --> 00:03:58,160
Take them twice a day after breakfast and dinner,

64
00:03:58,160 --> 00:03:59,320
two pills each time.

65
00:03:59,520 --> 00:04:01,040
Don't take them on an empty stomach. It'll upset your stomach.

66
00:04:01,040 --> 00:04:01,880
Then, when changing the dressing,

67
00:04:01,880 --> 00:04:03,640
disinfect it with this iodophor first,

68
00:04:03,640 --> 00:04:04,440
then wrap it with gauze.

69
00:04:04,440 --> 00:04:05,320
Don't wrap it too tightly.

70
00:04:05,320 --> 00:04:06,280
Make sure to come back for a follow-up in three days.

71
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:07,840
I'll check how the wound is healing.

72
00:04:07,840 --> 00:04:08,400
Okay.

73
00:04:08,400 --> 00:04:09,440
And the same goes for your wound.

74
00:04:09,440 --> 00:04:10,080
What I just told you,

75
00:04:10,080 --> 00:04:10,840
do you remember?

76
00:04:10,840 --> 00:04:12,440
Got it. We all got it.

77
00:04:12,440 --> 00:04:13,200
Thank you, Dr. Yang.

78
00:04:13,200 --> 00:04:14,640
Okay, I'll get going now.

79
00:04:14,640 --> 00:04:15,760
Goodbye.

80
00:04:17,320 --> 00:04:17,880
Mr. Wang.

81
00:04:18,360 --> 00:04:20,240
My dad called to ask where I was.

82
00:04:20,240 --> 00:04:21,240
I told him you were injured

83
00:04:21,240 --> 00:04:22,560
and I was with you at the clinic.

84
00:04:22,560 --> 00:04:24,120
He made a big table of Northeastern dishes.

85
00:04:24,120 --> 00:04:25,240
I wonder if you could do me the honor

86
00:04:25,240 --> 00:04:26,840
of coming home with me for a casual meal.

87
00:04:26,840 --> 00:04:28,370
My dad is a really good cook.

88
00:04:28,880 --> 00:04:30,080
Then I'll take you up on that.

89
00:04:30,080 --> 00:04:30,610
Let's go.

90
00:04:54,640 --> 00:04:56,600
What kind of skill is this, Young Master Hu?

91
00:04:56,600 --> 00:04:58,130
What's wrong? Can't focus?

92
00:05:06,280 --> 00:05:07,360
Brother Qian,

93
00:05:07,880 --> 00:05:08,840
about the thing I asked you to look into,

94
00:05:08,840 --> 00:05:10,300
did you find out anything?

95
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:13,360
Wang Hong has been in Xinchun for days.

96
00:05:13,520 --> 00:05:15,760
Do you know what kind of wood he wants?

97
00:05:16,440 --> 00:05:17,560
Don't rush.

98
00:05:17,880 --> 00:05:19,280
These days,

99
00:05:19,280 --> 00:05:20,280
big fish are rare.

100
00:05:20,680 --> 00:05:21,880
There are too few big bosses,

101
00:05:21,880 --> 00:05:23,810
and everyone has their eyes on him.

102
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:25,000
You know Lin Shengli.

103
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:26,360
His men are tight-lipped.

104
00:05:26,360 --> 00:05:28,360
I couldn't get anything out of them.

105
00:05:28,520 --> 00:05:31,480
So you mean I should just sit still

106
00:05:31,800 --> 00:05:34,000
and wait for Lin Shengli to eat all the meat,

107
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:36,060
leaving me without even a sip of soup?

108
00:05:36,640 --> 00:05:37,570
Young Master Hu,

109
00:05:37,640 --> 00:05:38,970
don't say I'm not loyal.

110
00:05:39,360 --> 00:05:40,490
I just got some news.

111
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:43,640
Wang Hong was discharged from the hospital today.

112
00:05:43,640 --> 00:05:44,400
Guess what?

113
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:45,800
What?

114
00:05:46,320 --> 00:05:47,360
Li Xuefei directly

115
00:05:47,360 --> 00:05:48,840
took him to her house.

116
00:05:51,040 --> 00:05:53,240
That chick Li Xuefei

117
00:05:53,880 --> 00:05:56,040
even took the man home.

118
00:05:56,240 --> 00:05:59,040
Li Zhijun and Li Xuefei,

119
00:05:59,040 --> 00:06:00,080
they look honest,

120
00:06:00,240 --> 00:06:01,640
but they are actually very shrewd.

121
00:06:01,640 --> 00:06:03,970
Isn't Li Zhijun's factory tight on funds?

122
00:06:04,080 --> 00:06:05,480
I think Li Xuefei is using a honey trap

123
00:06:05,480 --> 00:06:07,210
to trick Mr. Wang into signing.

124
00:06:08,640 --> 00:06:09,400
How about this?

125
00:06:09,400 --> 00:06:10,600
I'll give you an idea.

126
00:06:11,360 --> 00:06:13,200
Go see Li Zhijun now.

127
00:06:13,640 --> 00:06:15,170
You might bump into Mr. Wang

128
00:06:15,280 --> 00:06:16,880
and show him our strength.

129
00:06:17,880 --> 00:06:20,320
I don't believe Wang won't be tempted.

130
00:06:34,240 --> 00:06:35,800
Where are you going? Not playing anymore?

131
00:06:35,800 --> 00:06:37,060
None of your business.

132
00:06:39,800 --> 00:06:41,240
That was terrible.

133
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:44,400
Let me show you.

134
00:06:44,600 --> 00:06:45,800
Yes, lean over there.

135
00:06:48,400 --> 00:06:49,040
Sir.

136
00:06:54,080 --> 00:06:54,840
Have a cigarette.

137
00:06:54,840 --> 00:06:56,080
You can't smoke here.

138
00:06:56,080 --> 00:06:56,920
I'll hold it for you for now.

139
00:06:56,920 --> 00:06:58,000
Make sure not to smoke in the yard.

140
00:06:58,000 --> 00:06:58,880
No smoking.

141
00:06:59,520 --> 00:07:00,200
Okay.

142
00:07:01,560 --> 00:07:02,840
Well...

143
00:07:03,120 --> 00:07:04,580
I have a piece of wood here.

144
00:07:04,600 --> 00:07:05,880
Can you take a look

145
00:07:05,880 --> 00:07:07,410
and see how old this wood is?

146
00:07:15,200 --> 00:07:16,400
This is new material.

147
00:07:17,040 --> 00:07:18,000
New material?

148
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:19,600
No more than three years old.

149
00:07:21,280 --> 00:07:22,160
Are you sure?

150
00:07:22,160 --> 00:07:22,560
You...

151
00:07:22,560 --> 00:07:23,880
H-How can you tell?

152
00:07:23,880 --> 00:07:24,720
Look here.

153
00:07:24,720 --> 00:07:26,600
The color is light and pale.

154
00:07:26,600 --> 00:07:28,440
Smell it. It smells like pine oil,

155
00:07:28,440 --> 00:07:29,700
and it's quite strong.

156
00:07:30,120 --> 00:07:32,180
It means it hasn't dried completely.

157
00:07:32,680 --> 00:07:34,440
Feel this cross-section.

158
00:07:34,840 --> 00:07:35,480
The cross-section,

159
00:07:35,480 --> 00:07:37,320
it's n-not rough,

160
00:07:37,320 --> 00:07:38,720
so it's relatively new.

161
00:07:39,200 --> 00:07:40,280
Without weathering over the years,

162
00:07:40,280 --> 00:07:42,320
it lacks hardness.

163
00:07:42,920 --> 00:07:43,520
Sir,

164
00:07:43,720 --> 00:07:44,880
about this material,

165
00:07:44,880 --> 00:07:47,240
can you tell which factory it's from?

166
00:07:48,240 --> 00:07:49,240
I can't tell.

167
00:07:49,240 --> 00:07:51,880
Anyway, our small factory doesn't use this material.

168
00:07:51,880 --> 00:07:54,340
There are a few large factories using it now.

169
00:07:54,520 --> 00:07:55,440
Big factories.

170
00:07:55,440 --> 00:07:58,240
Several big factories nearby need this material.

171
00:08:06,240 --> 00:08:06,720
Bro.

172
00:08:07,120 --> 00:08:08,440
At a small hotel in the west of the city,

173
00:08:08,440 --> 00:08:10,240
an out-of-town boss was killed.

174
00:08:11,960 --> 00:08:13,480
I'm at the lumberyard.

175
00:08:13,760 --> 00:08:15,620
I'll be there as soon as possible.

176
00:08:15,800 --> 00:08:16,640
Thank you, sir.

177
00:08:16,640 --> 00:08:18,100
Thanks for your hard work.

178
00:08:19,200 --> 00:08:20,000
Come in.

179
00:08:20,760 --> 00:08:21,640
Dad.

180
00:08:21,880 --> 00:08:23,040
Mr. Wang is here.

181
00:08:23,160 --> 00:08:25,040
Okay, I have one more dish to cook.

182
00:08:25,160 --> 00:08:26,720
You entertain the guest first.

183
00:08:26,720 --> 00:08:27,280
Okay.

184
00:08:27,280 --> 00:08:28,480
Thanks for your hard work, Boss Li.

185
00:08:28,480 --> 00:08:30,210
It's nothing. Please sit down.

186
00:08:30,280 --> 00:08:30,920
The shoes...

187
00:08:30,920 --> 00:08:31,520
No need.

188
00:08:31,520 --> 00:08:32,840
Just come right in.

189
00:08:34,200 --> 00:08:35,120
Can I help you?

190
00:08:35,120 --> 00:08:35,760
No need.

191
00:08:35,760 --> 00:08:36,400
All done.

192
00:08:37,840 --> 00:08:38,679
The last dish.

193
00:08:41,280 --> 00:08:42,240
So lavish.

194
00:08:42,679 --> 00:08:44,080
You made such a big feast.

195
00:08:45,280 --> 00:08:48,000
I originally wanted to take you to a restaurant, Mr. Wang.

196
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:49,800
But then I thought it'd be better to eat at home.

197
00:08:49,800 --> 00:08:51,240
That way, you can taste the flavor of home.

198
00:08:51,240 --> 00:08:52,360
Eating at home is great.

199
00:08:52,360 --> 00:08:52,920
Boss Li.

200
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:53,920
Your cooking skills

201
00:08:53,920 --> 00:08:55,960
look even better than a restaurant's.

202
00:08:55,960 --> 00:08:58,040
We Northeasterners aren't too particular.

203
00:08:58,040 --> 00:09:00,040
The main thing is the food must be hot

204
00:09:00,200 --> 00:09:01,530
and the portions large.

205
00:09:03,920 --> 00:09:05,440
Mr. Wang, what kind of liquor should we drink?

206
00:09:05,440 --> 00:09:06,400
Mr. Li,

207
00:09:06,800 --> 00:09:07,960
he just got out of the hospital.

208
00:09:07,960 --> 00:09:09,160
He can't drink any alcohol.

209
00:09:09,160 --> 00:09:10,160
Right, right, right.

210
00:09:10,160 --> 00:09:11,720
Then let's have tea instead of liquor.

211
00:09:11,720 --> 00:09:12,720
It's fine. I can drink anything.

212
00:09:12,720 --> 00:09:13,320
Alright.

213
00:09:19,600 --> 00:09:20,520
Mr. Wang.

214
00:09:20,880 --> 00:09:23,320
You came all the way here from the south.

215
00:09:23,800 --> 00:09:25,640
What is your main business?

216
00:09:26,080 --> 00:09:27,480
Is it timber,

217
00:09:27,480 --> 00:09:28,520
or furniture?

218
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:29,920
I make coffins.

219
00:09:32,880 --> 00:09:34,520
Mr. Wang, you must be joking.

220
00:09:35,640 --> 00:09:37,080
Mr. Li, I'm not joking.

221
00:09:37,720 --> 00:09:39,280
What do you think I do?

222
00:09:42,600 --> 00:09:44,440
Mr. Wang, you are a dashing,

223
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:46,330
young and handsome man.

224
00:09:46,800 --> 00:09:50,060
You don't look like someone in the funeral business at all.

225
00:09:50,160 --> 00:09:51,960
I'm just trying to make a living.

226
00:09:52,160 --> 00:09:53,680
Life is so exhausting.

227
00:09:54,080 --> 00:09:55,600
Who doesn't want to leave with dignity?

228
00:09:55,600 --> 00:09:56,240
Right?

229
00:09:57,080 --> 00:09:58,610
Mr. Wang makes a good point.

230
00:09:59,120 --> 00:10:01,600
Dignity and stability are better than anything.

231
00:10:01,600 --> 00:10:04,120
Stop flattering each other, you two bosses.

232
00:10:04,120 --> 00:10:05,120
Let's eat.

233
00:10:05,120 --> 00:10:06,080
Right, right.

234
00:10:06,080 --> 00:10:06,520
Come on.

235
00:10:06,520 --> 00:10:07,480
Eat up.

236
00:10:08,000 --> 00:10:09,600
Try this Di San Xian.

237
00:10:11,520 --> 00:10:13,360
Who is it? What perfect timing.

238
00:10:13,360 --> 00:10:13,920
It's fine.

239
00:10:13,920 --> 00:10:14,780
Let's just eat.

240
00:10:14,880 --> 00:10:16,080
Try this Di San Xian.

241
00:10:20,480 --> 00:10:21,480
I have things in my hands.

242
00:10:21,480 --> 00:10:22,280
Why did you close the door?

243
00:10:22,280 --> 00:10:23,320
Who told you to come?

244
00:10:23,320 --> 00:10:24,520
Why are you so annoying?

245
00:10:24,520 --> 00:10:25,320
Who is it?

246
00:10:25,800 --> 00:10:26,600
Uncle Li.

247
00:10:26,600 --> 00:10:27,240
It's me, Xiaohu.

248
00:10:27,240 --> 00:10:27,760
You...

249
00:10:28,120 --> 00:10:29,280
I came to see you.

250
00:10:30,760 --> 00:10:31,890
Mr. Wang is here too.

251
00:10:32,080 --> 00:10:33,210
What a coincidence.

252
00:10:33,720 --> 00:10:36,080
You might as well eat the word 'coincidence' with your rice.

253
00:10:36,080 --> 00:10:37,400
Xiaohu is here just in time.

254
00:10:37,400 --> 00:10:38,730
Sit down and eat with us.

255
00:10:39,080 --> 00:10:39,610
Sit here.

256
00:10:40,960 --> 00:10:41,480
Okay.

257
00:10:42,240 --> 00:10:44,500
Then I'll have a few drinks with Uncle Li.

258
00:10:48,440 --> 00:10:49,170
Here, Uncle.

259
00:10:52,680 --> 00:10:54,010
I'll pass on the drinks.

260
00:10:54,080 --> 00:10:56,340
Why aren't you having a drink, Boss Wang?

261
00:10:59,480 --> 00:11:00,440
You're injured.

262
00:11:01,120 --> 00:11:02,120
But it's fine.

263
00:11:02,440 --> 00:11:05,040
It promotes blood circulation and removes stasis.

264
00:11:05,040 --> 00:11:06,100
Fine, don't drink.

265
00:11:06,880 --> 00:11:07,640
How about

266
00:11:07,840 --> 00:11:10,200
Xuefei drinks a few glasses for Boss Wang?

267
00:11:14,920 --> 00:11:16,980
Boss Wang, are your injuries better?

268
00:11:17,680 --> 00:11:18,840
Thank you for your concern, Boss Teng.

269
00:11:18,840 --> 00:11:19,570
Much better.

270
00:11:20,880 --> 00:11:22,480
I'm actually quite ashamed.

271
00:11:22,760 --> 00:11:25,040
Mr. Wang finally came to Xinchun,

272
00:11:25,800 --> 00:11:27,730
and I haven't even been a good host.

273
00:11:29,120 --> 00:11:29,980
How about this?

274
00:11:30,200 --> 00:11:32,530
My family has a hunting ground in Beishan.

275
00:11:32,680 --> 00:11:33,800
Uncle Li knows about it.

276
00:11:33,800 --> 00:11:35,040
You can enjoy the scenery

277
00:11:35,040 --> 00:11:36,170
and do some hunting.

278
00:11:36,600 --> 00:11:38,480
I'll take you up the mountain tomorrow

279
00:11:38,480 --> 00:11:39,720
just to relax.

280
00:11:40,760 --> 00:11:42,000
Please do me the honor,

281
00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:42,530
Mr. Wang.

282
00:11:46,400 --> 00:11:48,440
Sister Xuefei, you should come along too.

283
00:11:48,440 --> 00:11:50,440
Mr. Wang hasn't fully recovered yet.

284
00:11:50,440 --> 00:11:52,840
If you go, we'll all feel relieved.

285
00:11:53,400 --> 00:11:54,600
Right, Uncle Li?

286
00:11:55,400 --> 00:11:56,240
Xiaohu.

287
00:11:56,640 --> 00:11:59,040
It's windy at your Beishan Hunting Ground.

288
00:11:59,200 --> 00:12:01,000
Mr. Wang just got out of the hospital.

289
00:12:01,000 --> 00:12:02,160
Let's do it another day.

290
00:12:02,160 --> 00:12:03,480
Then we won't hunt.

291
00:12:03,640 --> 00:12:05,120
We'll just take a walk on the mountain

292
00:12:05,120 --> 00:12:06,480
and cultivate our minds.

293
00:12:06,480 --> 00:12:06,940
Xiaohu,

294
00:12:07,040 --> 00:12:08,480
we appreciate your kindness,

295
00:12:08,480 --> 00:12:09,740
but maybe another day.

296
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:10,860
It's fine, Dad.

297
00:12:12,040 --> 00:12:13,240
It's okay for us to go.

298
00:12:13,640 --> 00:12:16,640
Let's see the hunting ground of the Xinchun landlord.

299
00:12:17,680 --> 00:12:19,200
Thank you for your hospitality, Boss Teng.

300
00:12:19,200 --> 00:12:21,060
We'll go and cultivate our taste.

301
00:12:22,240 --> 00:12:23,300
Straightforward.

302
00:12:23,600 --> 00:12:24,520
Tomorrow at twelve,

303
00:12:24,520 --> 00:12:26,720
I'll send a car to pick you two up on time.

304
00:12:27,200 --> 00:12:28,930
I'll get going first, Uncle Li.

305
00:12:29,160 --> 00:12:30,280
Eat before you go.

306
00:12:30,520 --> 00:12:32,280
No thanks, I have something to do at home.

307
00:12:32,280 --> 00:12:34,680
I'll have a good drink with you in a few days.

308
00:12:34,920 --> 00:12:35,920
Goodbye, Uncle.

309
00:12:40,920 --> 00:12:42,200
He brought gifts,

310
00:12:43,400 --> 00:12:44,660
didn't drink the wine,

311
00:12:45,360 --> 00:12:46,160
and left.

312
00:12:46,800 --> 00:12:47,800
He's up to no good.

313
00:12:50,480 --> 00:12:52,400
Let's eat. Come on.

314
00:12:55,880 --> 00:12:56,720
Try this fish.

315
00:12:57,160 --> 00:12:57,680
Okay.

316
00:13:01,440 --> 00:13:02,240
Officer Liu,

317
00:13:02,760 --> 00:13:03,880
how is the scene?

318
00:13:04,480 --> 00:13:06,120
We've completed the preliminary investigation.

319
00:13:06,120 --> 00:13:08,400
The victim has a single stab wound to the chest.

320
00:13:08,400 --> 00:13:09,200
Time of death

321
00:13:09,200 --> 00:13:10,930
is estimated to be 20 hours ago.

322
00:13:25,400 --> 00:13:25,930
Brother,

323
00:13:26,120 --> 00:13:27,650
the victim is Zhou Guangfu.

324
00:13:27,680 --> 00:13:28,760
His secretary lives next door.

325
00:13:28,760 --> 00:13:29,400
I just asked.

326
00:13:29,400 --> 00:13:30,480
The money doesn't add up.

327
00:13:30,480 --> 00:13:31,810
The bulk of it was taken.

328
00:13:32,280 --> 00:13:34,240
They came from out of town to buy timber.

329
00:13:34,240 --> 00:13:35,640
To avoid attention,

330
00:13:35,640 --> 00:13:36,900
they found this motel.

331
00:13:37,240 --> 00:13:38,640
His secretary went out for dinner yesterday.

332
00:13:38,640 --> 00:13:41,970
The front desk said they didn't see anyone come in all night.

333
00:14:01,520 --> 00:14:02,250
Officer Liu,

334
00:14:03,160 --> 00:14:04,120
there's a footprint here.

335
00:14:04,120 --> 00:14:04,680
Okay.

336
00:14:08,680 --> 00:14:09,640
This person

337
00:14:10,440 --> 00:14:11,600
didn't walk in.

338
00:14:12,040 --> 00:14:13,080
He crawled in.

339
00:14:13,360 --> 00:14:14,440
Crawled in?

340
00:14:14,640 --> 00:14:15,160
Yes.

341
00:14:58,840 --> 00:14:59,880
Give me back my money!

342
00:14:59,880 --> 00:15:00,440
Who is it?

343
00:15:00,560 --> 00:15:02,220
Don't take my money! My money!

344
00:15:02,320 --> 00:15:03,000
Let go!

345
00:15:03,360 --> 00:15:04,520
Give me the money!

346
00:15:04,760 --> 00:15:05,680
Let go!

347
00:15:22,480 --> 00:15:23,440
This person

348
00:15:23,960 --> 00:15:25,690
climbed up from the outer wall.

349
00:15:25,800 --> 00:15:27,530
Climbed up from the outer wall?

350
00:15:27,760 --> 00:15:28,760
Five floors, brother.

351
00:15:28,760 --> 00:15:29,800
How bold.

352
00:15:29,800 --> 00:15:30,440
If he missed a step,

353
00:15:30,440 --> 00:15:32,480
he'd be dead or crippled from the fall.

354
00:15:32,480 --> 00:15:34,880
You can count the number of people like this

355
00:15:35,560 --> 00:15:37,160
in Xinchun on one hand.

356
00:15:39,800 --> 00:15:41,640
Brother, Zhou Guangfu had so much money.

357
00:15:41,640 --> 00:15:43,700
Could this person be after the money?

358
00:15:45,480 --> 00:15:47,680
Judging from the scene,

359
00:15:48,160 --> 00:15:49,620
they were after the money.

360
00:15:50,920 --> 00:15:51,920
As for the victim,

361
00:15:53,320 --> 00:15:55,320
he was probably killed by accident.

362
00:15:56,040 --> 00:15:57,170
Here's the plan, Ma.

363
00:15:57,320 --> 00:15:58,040
Go and check

364
00:15:58,040 --> 00:16:00,560
everyone in Xinchun with a record of theft.

365
00:16:00,920 --> 00:16:01,880
Pay special attention

366
00:16:01,880 --> 00:16:04,280
to those who grew up in the forestry center.

367
00:16:04,720 --> 00:16:06,640
Brother, do you know something?

368
00:16:07,440 --> 00:16:10,520
Why do we have to check those who grew up in the forestry center?

369
00:16:10,520 --> 00:16:11,400
Just check.

370
00:16:12,320 --> 00:16:13,050
Understood.

371
00:16:22,920 --> 00:16:24,200
This case

372
00:16:24,840 --> 00:16:26,040
and Liu Ming's case

373
00:16:28,760 --> 00:16:30,600
couldn't have been done by the same person, right?
